{
  "id": 490160301,
  "iid": 25149,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "NAS-5GS: Parse URSP Time window, PDU session pair ID, and RSN descriptors",
  "description": "## Summary\n\nAdd parsing for three route selection descriptor component types in URSP rules that were previously showing \"IE not dissected yet\".\n\n## Problem\n\nThe route selection descriptor parser (`de_nas_5gs_ursp_r_sel_desc`) is missing `case` handlers for types 0x80, 0x82, and 0x83. When any of these types is encountered, the `default` branch calls `proto_tree_add_expert_remaining()` which displays \"IE not dissected yet\" and abandons parsing of all subsequent components in the same RSD contents block.\n\n## Changes\n\nAdded three new cases to the RSD switch statement:\n\n- **0x80 (Time window)**: 16 bytes total — start time (8 bytes) + stop time (8 bytes), each as UNIX epoch seconds with 1/2^32 fractional seconds (`ENC_TIME_RTPS`)\n- **0x82 (PDU session pair ID)**: 1 byte identifier value\n- **0x83 (RSN)**: 1 byte value (0=v1, 1=v2)\n\nAlso added 4 new `hf` field declarations and registrations.\n\n## Specification Reference\n\n3GPP TS 24.526 Section 5.2:\n\n> For \"Time window type\", the route selection descriptor component value field shall be encoded as a sequence of a four octet start time field, a four octet start time fraction field, a four octet stop time field, and a four octet stop time fraction field.\n\n> For \"PDU session pair ID type\", the route selection descriptor component value field shall be encoded as one octet which specifies the PDU session pair identifier value.\n\n> For \"RSN type\", the route selection descriptor component value field shall be encoded as one octet which specifies the RSN value.\n\n## Testing\n\nVerified with pcap files:\n\n- **Time window (0x80)**\n  - Before: `IE not dissected yet`\n  - After: `Start time: Dec 31, 2025 15:00:00 UTC` / `Stop time: Dec 31, 2026 14:59:59 UTC`\n\n- **PDU session pair ID (0x82)**\n  - Before: `IE not dissected yet`\n  - After: `PDU session pair ID: 1`\n\n- **RSN (0x83)**\n  - Before: `IE not dissected yet`\n  - After: `RSN: 0`\n\nReproduction pcaps:\n- [RSD_0x80_time_window.pcap](https://gitlab.com/-/project/82634231/uploads/9b019d111dad16c36b7b6f58356ad724/RSD_0x80_time_window.pcap)\n- [RSD_0x82_PDU_session_pair_ID.pcap](https://gitlab.com/-/project/82634231/uploads/75a2c33a7c6e865f24d12dd2c9fb7a8c/RSD_0x82_PDU_session_pair_ID.pcap)\n- [RSD_0x83_RSN.pcap](https://gitlab.com/-/project/82634231/uploads/6a14a946963bd4e1ad1551d8322becf2/RSD_0x83_RSN.pcap)",
